ty-100\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10 whitespace-nowrap\">Me contacter</span></a></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center\"><button class=\"group relative flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full px-3 text-zinc-500 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-white/50 dark:hover:text-white\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 100%);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);backdrop-filter:blur(12px)\" aria-label=\"Toggle Language\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">EN</span></button></div><button class=\"z-50 relative flex h-10 w-10 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full md:hidden\" style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);backdrop-filter:blur(12px)\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span class=\"h-[1.5px] w-5 bg-zinc-900 transition-all duration-300 dark:bg-white \"></span><span class=\"h-[1.5px] w-5 bg-zinc-900 transition-all duration-300 dark:bg-white \"></span><span class=\"h-[1.5px] w-5 bg-zinc-900 transition-all duration-300 dark:bg-white \"></span></button></div></header><main class=\"relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center pt-24 pb-12 px-4 selection:bg-brand-blue/30 overflow-hidden bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-[#020202]\"><a class=\"absolute top-8 left-8 z-50 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium backdrop-blur-md transition-hover hover:bg-white dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-white/80 dark:hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/#projects\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>Retour</a><div class=\"absolute top-[10%] left-1/2 -z-10 h-[60vw] w-[60vw] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full blur-[120px]\" style=\"background-color:rgb(196, 87, 76);opacity:0\"></div><div class=\"relative flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] md:p-12\"><header class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-600 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-300\">C</span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-600 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-300\">Logique de Jeu</span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-600 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-300\">Pointeurs C</span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-600 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-300\">Arithmétique Modulaire</span></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-zinc-900 md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl dark:text-white\">Awale - Stratégie en C</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 md:text-xl\">Conception architecturale et implémentation en langage formel C de la mécanique combinatoire du jeu de société Awale. Ce projet focalise principalement sur la performance algorithmique pure, la gestion déterministe de la mémoire et la logique d&#x27;état asymétrique continue.</p></header><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-6 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 flex items-center gap-3 dark:text-white/90\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-700 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></span>Analyse de l&#x27;Ingénierie &amp; Solutions</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">La difficulté majeure résidait dans la modélisation mathématique d&#x27;un plateau de jeu strictement cyclique sans causer de débordement dynamique en mémoire vive. L&#x27;approche d&#x27;ingénierie a consisté à encapsuler le plateau dans des structures de données contiguës, manipulées perpétuellement via l&#x27;arithmétique modulaire et des pointeurs de fonctions robustes.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-6 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 flex items-center gap-3 dark:text-white/90\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg\" style=\"background-color:rgb(196, 87, 76)20;color:rgb(196, 87, 76)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></span>Résultat &amp; Impact</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">Moteur de jeu s&#x27;exécutant dans un espace mémoire strictement borné, sans dépassement ni fuite, validé sur l&#x27;ensemble des scénarios de partie cyclique.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 h-[1px] w-full origin-left bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-zinc-200 to-transparent dark:via-white/20\" style=\"transform:scaleX(0)\"></div><footer class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-sm italic text-zinc-500\">Source privée / académique</span></footer><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-2 w-full\" style=\"background:rgb(196, 87, 76)\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 relative z-10\"><a class=\"group flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-center gap-1 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]/50 dark:hover:bg-[#0a0a0a]\" href=\"/projects/robotino-hockey-autonome-2026\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-blue dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Projet précédent</span><span class=\"line-clamp-1 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white/90\">Robotino – Hockey Autonome</span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-1 flex-col items-end justify-center gap-1 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white/50 p-6 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-white hover:shadow-lg dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]/50 dark:hover:bg-[#0a0a0a] text-right\" href=\"/projects/py